    question: 'A sphere of mass M moving with velocity v_0 collides elastically with another sphere of mass m which is initially at rest. The collision is oblique. If M > m, what is the sine of the maximum deflection angle \\theta_{max} of the sphere of mass M relative to its initial direction of motion?',
