      example: 'Domestic AC power supply in India is rated at $220\\text{ V}$ at $50\\text{ Hz}$. The $220\\text{ V}$ rating is the RMS value. The peak voltage is $V_m = 220\\sqrt{2} \\approx 311\\text{ V}$.',
