        correctAnswerIndex: 0,
        explanation: 'Displacement vector d = OB - OA = (2-1)i + (3-1)j + (5-1)k = i + 2j + 4k. Work done W = F . d = (2i + j + k) . (i + 2j + 4k) = 2(1) + 1(2) + 1(4) = 2 + 2 + 4 = 8 units.'
