        options: ['i - 2j + k', 'i + 2j - k', '-i + 2j - k', '0'],
        correctAnswerIndex: 0,
        explanation: 'Torque tau = r x F, where r is the position vector of the point P relative to the reference point (origin): r = i + j + k. tau = r x F = determinant [[i, j, k], [1, 1, 1], [1, 2, 3]] = i(3-2) - j(3-1) + k(2-1) = i - 2j + k.'
